                                "sense_id": "4168f245-b7a2-3b8d-9e8f-d988d75ec278",
                                "text": "Although it's always crowded\nYou still can find some room\nFor broken-hearted lovers\nTo cry there in their gloom."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
